# Formatting boundary for `pnpm format` / `pnpm format:check` / `pnpm verify`.
#
# The maintained formatting boundary is the developer-workflow surface that
# `scripts/format-check.mjs` enforces: scripts, generated-client config,
# workspace YAML/JSON config, and any tracked code/config file
# changed on the current branch. Everything ignored here is intentionally
# outside that boundary and is documented in docs/specs/phase-3-developer-workflow.md.
node_modules/
.git/
**/node_modules/

# Machine-generated / build output.
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
.next/
**/generated/
attached_assets/

# Lockfile formats are written by package managers, not maintained by hand.
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Environment example/value files carry the Auth0/MongoDB onboarding contract.
# Their formatting is layout-sensitive (shell/ini) and intentionally not
# prettier-enforced.
.env*
*.env

# Prose documentation is maintained by hand; prettier reflow is not enforced.
docs/
**/*.md
